Create app.js with:
let total = 0;
for (let i = 1; i <= 10; i++) {
  total = total + i;
}
console.log('Sum is', total);
Link it to your page, open the developer console and confirm it shows Sum is 55.

Build a click counter: add <button id="btn">Click me</button> and <p id="out">0</p>. In app.js:
let n = 0;
document.querySelector('#btn').addEventListener('click', () => {
  n++;
  document.querySelector('#out').textContent = n;
});
Click and watch the number rise.
